 """Queue worker loop.
 
 The worker pulls one message at a time and dispatches it to a registered
-handler.  There is no redelivery accounting yet: a failing message is
-nacked back onto the queue and tried again forever.
+handler.  Redelivery is now accounted for so that a message which cannot
+succeed is retired to the dead-letter queue instead of cycling forever.
